-- =====================================================================
-- Demo: "NTT DATA Digital Innovation Challenge 2026 Roadshow @ Silpakorn
-- University", from its real poster and announcement, with the department
-- newsletter (จดหมายข่าว ฉบับที่ 65, ส.ค. 2569) as its SAR recap poster.
--
-- Thu 27 Aug 2569 (2026), 13.00–14.00, ห้อง 2301 ชั้น 3 อาคารวิทยาศาสตร์ 2;
-- for CS, IT and DS students in year 3 and above. Run with NTT DATA, who
-- covered it, so the department set no budget. Finished and closed, with
-- certificates (their evaluations and certificates come from
-- seed_certificates.sql, which must run after this file). The system knows
-- only CS and IT, so DS is mentioned in the description only.
--
-- The poster is 1076 x 1522; posters here must be 1:1, 3:4 or 9:16, so it is
-- padded to 3:4 (1142 x 1522) by repeating its left and right columns.
--
-- Who came: the demo students in year 3+ (none suspended); one registered but
-- didn't come.
--
-- Apply AFTER schema, seed, demo_organizer, seed_blacklist. Safe to run
-- again: it removes event 1056 (registrations, check-ins, evaluations,
-- certificates and SAR cascade) first — then run seed_certificates.sql again.
--   docker exec -i cpsu-etms-mysql mysql --default-character-set=utf8mb4 -uroot cpsu_etms < database/seed_ntt_roadshow.sql
-- =====================================================================

USE cpsu_etms;
SET NAMES utf8mb4;

DELETE FROM events WHERE id = 1056;

